  SSG is proud & honored to call Dan Flood one of our Senior
  Security Specialists. Dan is a leader on SSG & is a former
  United States Marine & a professional model! He is one of
  the "Original SSG" team members & brings experience,
  professionalism, leadership & customer service to our
  valued Clients!
  Dan is one of the reasons #ShafferSecurityGroup is the
  best in our industry. He truly is one of the "Best in the
  Business".
